  "result": "The plan is written, but I haven't changed any code yet, because plan mode is still on and the approval tool (`ExitPlanMode`) isn't available in this session.\n\n**Cause:** In `src/click/core.py:392`, a child context copies its parent's whole `default_map`. It should take only the entry for its own command name. With `default_map={\"runserver\": {\"port\": 5000}}`, the `runserver` command looks for `port` in the top-level dict and never finds it.\n\n**Fix:** Change line 392 to `default_map = parent.default_map.get(info_name)`.\n\n**Verification:**\n- Add tests for a group with a subcommand, covering `default_map` passed to `invoke`, `context_settings`, and a nested group.\n- Run the existing defaults, context and options tests, then the full suite.\n- Add a `CHANGES.md` entry.\n\nThe full plan is in `<home>\\.claude\\plans\\defaults-configured-through-default-map-eventual-wren.md`. Tell me to proceed, or take plan mode off, and I'll make the change.",
